  "ruleText": "Rev 1001.18 “Snus and snuff” means any finely cut, ground, or powdered tobacco that is moist and not intended to be smoked.\n\nSource. #10536, eff 3-6-14; renumbered by #12639 (formerly Rev 1001.13); ss by #13817, eff 12-1-23 (formerly Rev 1001.16) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Rev 1000)",
